    - 6.2999997
    passiveDescription: "\u2776 <b>Speed augment</b>: Your cards gain <b><color=#222>+1</color></b>
      <b><color=#395>free attack action</color></b> which also doesn't use its dice
      <i>(once per round)</i>.\n\U0001F517 <b>Coup de gr\xE2ce</b>: When I <b>attack
      \U0001F4A5</b> , this attack <b><color=#900>executes</color></b> when the target's
      <b><color=#583>HP</color></b> is less than or equal to <b>6</b> after the attack.\n"
    passiveBuffDescriptions: "<b>\U0001F4A5 On hit</b>: <b><color=#222></color></b>
      <b><color=#900>attack</color></b>, from myself\n"
